  "id": "cil",
  "term": "CIL",
  "definition": "CIL, or class-incremental learning, is a form of learning in which a model keeps adding new categories over time while trying to retain what it learned about earlier categories. A central challenge is avoiding catastrophic forgetting, where performance on older classes declines as the model adapts to new ones.",
